# xFacts label vs nutrition metaphor

On product surfaces (READMEs, npm, GitHub, LocalHelm, FilePress footers, shelf cards) the heading is **xFacts label**. Never "Nutrition label".

Keep "nutrition label" in teaching copy: essays, GENESIS, suite vision, the food analogy.

Do not rename the published blog post "Nutrition Labels for AI". The AppFacts hero "Nutrition Facts label for software" is a separate pass.
